..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : EKLAB.TBUVORSCHLAG.BN
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : ôffnet Bestellvorschlagsmaske Åber .kommando
.. Functionality  : Opens purchase order suggestion mask with .command
...Includes       :
..  include     ek/EKLAB.BSTART.BV
..*****************************************************************************
..<META M|='ek/EKLAB'>
.set trans -
..
.continue FATAL   ? _G|evtartengl = "BUTTON_AFTER"
.continue FATAL   ? _G|evtvar = "tbuvorschlag" & _G|evtvar = "tbuvorschlag2"
.continue REFRESH ? G|evtvar = "tbuvorschlag2"
..
.command -wait 'M|tcommand'
..
!REFRESH
.input "EKLAB.BSTART.BV" ?  M|kbzeileakt
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
!FATAL: Wrong usage
.error -number 1111
.end 1
